<h3 id="6-instagram-users-by-gender"><b>6. Instagram users by gender</b></h3>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Instagram audience includes both female and male users. However, usage differs by country and research method. In Pew Research Center’s 2025 US survey, 55% of women reported using Instagram in the US, compared with 44% of men.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Around 52.5% of Instagram’s worldwide audience is male, while 46.4% identify as female. Use Instagram insights to know your followers&#8217; gender, age, and location to curate tailored content and campaigns. </span></p>
<h3 id="7-instagram-usage-is-higher-in-urban-and-suburban-areas"><b>7. Instagram usage is higher in urban and suburban areas</b></h3>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">As per the Pew Research Center, 55% of US adults live in urban areas and 54% in suburban areas, compared with 37% in rural areas. This insight offers useful context for regional campaigns, local targeting, and businesses that have metro-area audiences.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">However, the brands that are targeting rural customers should also consider other social media channels to reach their audience more effectively. </span></p>
