<h3 id="8-users-spend-about-33-minutes-a-day-on-instagram"><b>8. Users spend about 33 minutes a day on Instagram</b></h3>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Instagram users worldwide spend approx. 33 to 34 minutes on this app. However, the daily and monthly average might vary by age group or region. According to BofA Global Research, Indian users spend an average of 49 hours per month on Instagram.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">It breaks down to roughly 1.6 hours a day, making it one of the most used apps in India by monthly usage time. But remember, people scroll fast, so you only have seconds to grab the user&#8217;s attention. </span></p>
<h3 id="9-instagram-is-widely-used-by-social-media-users"><b>9. Instagram is widely used by social media users</b></h3>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Approximately 35.34% of the world’s active social media users regularly access Instagram and have a profile on it. The platform allows businesses to reach customers, build awareness, and introduce them to new products.</span></p>
<h3 id="10-many-users-plan-to-spend-more-time-on-instagram-in-2026"><b>10. Many users plan to spend more time on Instagram in 2026</b></h3>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">According to Sprout Social, 32% of Instagram users expect to spend more time on the platform in 2026. When it comes to Gen Z users, the figure rises to 41%, which makes Instagram a leading choice if you target this audience of young generation.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">For marketers, this signals an opportunity to invest in engaging content, creator partnerships, and targeted campaigns to connect with growing audiences.</span></p>
<h3 id="11-instagram-inspires-users-to-discover-new-products"><b>11. Instagram inspires users to discover new products</b></h3>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">From trending Reels to influencer recommendations, Instagram gives users many ways to discover products and explore new brands. Sprout Social’s 2026 Social Media Content Strategy Report found that more than a quarter of social media users across every generation use Instagram to find products they may want to buy.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Businesses can use product demos, creator collaborations, and customer reviews to help potential buyers explore their offerings and make informed purchase decisions.</span></p>
