<h3 id="14-reels-can-attract-475-likes-and-90-shares"><b>14. Reels can attract 475 likes and 90 shares</b></h3>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">As per Statista, the average Instagram Reel in 2025 generated around 475 likes and 90 shares. Generally, Reels received 18 comments and approx under 39 saves. The figure can vary based on your account size, topic, and audience.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">If your brand is seeking more reach and viral potential, Reels are the best Instagram way to get you there. Businesses can start by testing out short and useful videos that answer customer questions or show how their products actually work. </span></p>
<h3 id="15-reels-take-up-half-of-the-time-people-spend-on-instagram"><b>15. Reels take up half of the time people spend on Instagram </b></h3>
